/==//=====/ Title /=====//==/

Sans Fanfic: Terraria Adventure

/==//==/ Description /==//==/

[h2]WARNING: Full of spoilers for Undertale and Deltarune (and lots of other stuff too)![/h2]

This resource pack aims to change [b][i]every single asset[/i][/b] to be themed around [url=https://sans-fanfic.tumblr.com/about]Sans Fanfic[/url]!

That's [b]14,994[/b] images, [b]19,963[/b] text entries, [b]104[/b] songs and [b]851[/b] sounds! (and also like 5 fonts)
It is by no means complete, and development is ongoing.

[hr][/hr]

